# =============================================================================
#  hieroglyph-deep-perkeo.jaml — DEEP pack-slot search (the depth proof)
# =============================================================================
#  The booster-pack PRNG stream emits SIX packs at every ante (slots 0-5), but
#  normal ante-1 gameplay only reaches slot 3. Buying Hieroglyph (or Petroglyph)
#  rewinds an ante and re-opens the shop, making the deeper slots 4-5 reachable.
#
#  `earlyAntesMaxPack: 5` is the opt-in that tells the engine to scan that full
#  depth in early antes instead of clamping to slot 3.
#
#  Canonical seed: KHTW99TC — a Negative Perkeo sits in the ante-1 Arcana at
#  pack slot 5, invisible without this opt-in. (See Motely.Tests/
#  HieroglyphPackSlotTests.cs and the seedfinder research doc.)
# =============================================================================

id: hieroglyph-deep-perkeo
name: Hieroglyph Deep Perkeo
author: pifreak
description: >-
  Negative Perkeo at ante-1 booster pack slot 5 — only reachable with the
  Hieroglyph/Petroglyph ante rewind. Proves JAML can search the full pack depth.
deck: Red
stake: White

must:
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    edition: Negative
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]  # the full six-pack stream...
      earlyAntesMaxPack: 5              # ...and DON'T clamp ante 1 to slot 3
